Third-party code: utils/
--------------------------
The following files are adapted from Angelina Aquino & Joshua Tsang's
University of the Philippines Diliman undergraduate project, "DSP01: A
hybrid grapheme-to-phoneme and speech recognition system for automated
phonetic transcription of speech data in Tagalog, Cebuano, and Hiligaynon"
(https://github.com/AngelAquino/g2p-asr; published as Aquino, Tsang, Lucas &
de Leon, "G2P and ASR techniques for low-resource phonetic transcription of
Tagalog, Cebuano, and Hiligaynon," ISMAC 2019,
https://doi.org/10.1109/ISMAC.2019.8836168):

  - utils/calculate_g2p_accuracy.py
  - utils/preprocessing_tools.py
  - utils/g2p_parsing.py
  - utils/alignment.py

The upstream project carries no license of its own, so these files are NOT
covered by this repository's MIT license. They are included here for
transparency and attribution only. If you want to reuse them beyond viewing
this repository, contact the original authors.

